Service and Value Creation

The book teaches that success is tied to service. Money and recognition come when you solve problems and add value to others’ lives. People with PMA focus on contribution rather than entitlement.

Environment and Association

You become like the people you associate with. Negative people weaken PMA, while positive thinkers reinforce it. The book advises consciously choosing:

Positive environments

Growth-focused people

Encouraging influences

Handling Failure

Failure is not the opposite of success—it is part of it. People with PMA:

Learn from mistakes

